# Scout spike (M156): venv, detector weights and icon cache, recordings, caches.
# Run data never goes to git (M166): the repository is public and a run holds
# ten players' positions. Runs travel to brain with `python -m scout.session send`.
tools/scout/.venv/
tools/scout/models/
tools/scout/runs/
tools/scout/**/*.pt
tools/scout/*.egg-info/
tools/scout/**/__pycache__/
tools/scout/**/.pytest_cache/
tools/scout/runs/**/rec/
tools/scout/**/*.webm
# M156 half C: the round's plots and frame strips are derived from a run (ten
# players' positions); the overseer serves them from the worktree, never from git.
.planning/missions/M156/publish-round-r2/plots/
.planning/missions/M156/publish-round-r2/strips/
